{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"0afc8de1-e52f-4ca7-90f6-1d5650879396","step":{"id":"s1","script":"On the unit circle, sine is a point’s vertical coordinate. Starting at the rightmost point, that height is zero.","ops":[{"op":"diagram","id":"circle","region":"left","primitives":[{"kind":"ellipse","center":[0.5,0.5],"radius":[0.32,0.296],"stroke":"solid"},{"kind":"line","points":[[0.1,0.5],[0.9,0.5]],"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"line","points":[[0.5,0.15],[0.5,0.85]],"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"line","points":[[0.5,0.5],[0.82,0.5]],"stroke":"solid","label":"radius 1"},{"kind":"point","at":[0.82,0.5],"label":"height 0"},{"kind":"text","at":[0.5,0.08],"content":"Unit circle","size":"large"}]},{"op":"axes","id":"waveaxes","region":"right","x":{"min":0,"max":6.2832,"label":"θ (radians)"},"y":{"min":-1.3,"max":1.3,"label":"sin θ"}}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"0afc8de1-e52f-4ca7-90f6-1d5650879396","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Rotate counterclockwise through a quarter turn. The height rises from zero to one, drawing the first part of the sine wave.","ops":[{"op":"arrow","id":"topradius","canvas_id":"circle","from":[0.5,0.5],"to":[0.5,0.204],"stroke":"solid","label":"height 1"},{"op":"angle_arc","id":"quarter","canvas_id":"circle","center":[0.5,0.5],"radius":0.15,"start_deg":0,"end_deg":-90,"stroke":"solid","label":"π/2"},{"op":"curve","id":"firstquarter","axes_id":"waveaxes","expr":"sin(x)","domain":[0,1.5707963268]},{"op":"equation","id":"peakvalue","anchor":{"el":"waveaxes","side":"below","gap":0.03},"latex":"\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)=1"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"After half a turn, what is the point’s height, and therefore its sine?","expected_gist":"The point is on the horizontal axis, so its height and sine are zero."}}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"0afc8de1-e52f-4ca7-90f6-1d5650879396","step":{"id":"s3","script":"Continue around: the height returns to zero, falls to minus one, then returns to zero. Each full turn repeats the same wave.","ops":[{"op":"curve","id":"restwave","axes_id":"waveaxes","expr":"sin(x)","domain":[1.5707963268,6.2831853072]},{"op":"arrow","id":"bottomradius","canvas_id":"circle","from":[0.5,0.5],"to":[0.5,0.796],"stroke":"solid","label":"height −1"},{"op":"point","id":"halfturn","canvas_id":"circle","at":[0.18,0.5],"label":"π: height 0"},{"op":"equation","id":"period","anchor":{"el":"peakvalue","side":"below","gap":0.04},"latex":"\\sin(\\theta+2\\pi)=\\sin\\theta"}],"checkpoint":null}}
